                <head>No. 105.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Hosmer</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-08-27"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 27,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Government of Mexico assures the Government of the United States that it will
                    not interfere with Guatemala’s domestic affairs and the United States rely on
                    this assurance.</p>
            </div>
